  "question": {
    "text": "If $z^2+z+1=0$, where $z$ is a complex number, then the value of\n$$\n\\left(z+\\frac{1}{z}\\right)^2+\\left(z^2+\\frac{1}{z^2}\\right)^2+\\left(z^3+\\frac{1}{z^3}\\right)^2+\\cdots+\\left(z^6+\\frac{1}{z^6}\\right)^2\n$$",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "Z8vE2",
      "text": "\n18\n",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
